	<section_number>15.2-5705</section_number>
	<catch_line>Violation of rules and regulations</catch_line>
	<text>
		Any violation of any such rule and regulation adopted pursuant to subdivision 18 of § 15.2-5704 shall constitute a Class 4 misdemeanor.
	</text>
